{"resourceIdentifier":"3970","resourceName":"Carbon In Flavor and Arome Forests (C-BOSAR)","description":"The Carbon in Flavor and Aroma Forest (C-BOSAR), is a ARR carbon sequestration grouped project proposed by PROJECT SIERRA , designed by ECOTIERRA and\r\nRIOSIERRA with the support of RED ECOLSIERRA . The project is based on improving existent land use models to introduce coffee, cocoa, and honey agroforestry systems. The project aims to develop improved agroforestry systems for the production of shade coffee, cocoa and honey, with organic and fair-trade certification, through tree planting, the restoration of the community-nature relationship, technical training and assistance and contribution to the strengthening of value chains for these products\r\nin the Sierra Nevada de Santa Marta and the Serranía del Perijá.","location":{"latitude":-73.518700,"longitude":10.431600},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-03-01","endExclusive":"2023-04-01","endInclusive":"2023-03-31"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3970"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Magdalena, La Guajira and Cesar departments"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"10247"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3858 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_RE